<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In AntiDote: Bi-level Adversarial Training for Tamper-Resistant LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Varying the Ratio of Harmful content</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In AntiDote: Bi-level Adversarial Training for Tamper-Resistant LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
